<SiteLayout title="About — Sentinel Agency" description="About Sentinel Agency, an Austin, Texas recruiting and staffing firm focused on high-signal search and candidate representation.">
<section class="hero wrap"><div><p class="eyebrow">ABOUT SENTINEL</p><h1>A recruiting firm built around signal.</h1><p class="lede">Sentinel Agency is an Austin, Texas staffing and talent firm designed for difficult searches: technical depth, compressed timelines, unclear markets and roles where false positives are expensive.</p></div></section>
<section class="wrap section two"><div><p class="eyebrow">POINT OF VIEW</p><h2>Recruiting should reduce uncertainty.</h2><p>The agency model is intentionally small, technical and evidence-driven. We prefer calibrated briefs, structured evaluation and transparent feedback over résumé volume.</p></div><div class="list"><div><span>01</span><b>Signal over volume</b><i>↗</i></div><div><span>02</span><b>Evidence over pedigree</b><i>↗</i></div><div><span>03</span><b>Consent over spam</b><i>↗</i></div><div><span>04</span><b>Long-term fit over fast fills</b><i>↗</i></div></div></section>
<section class="wrap section"><p class="eyebrow">HOME BASE</p><div class="split"><h2>Austin, Texas.</h2><p>Sentinel is headquartered in Austin and designed to support employers and talent nationwide. The operating platform is built to support direct hire, retained search, contract staffing, executive recruiting and talent intelligence from one system of record.</p></div></section>
